### Test Payment System

### 1. Generate Payment (Public - No Auth Required - Guest Payment)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phonenumber": "+2348123456789"
}

### 1b. Generate Payment for Authenticated User (Requires Authentication)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments/generate-user
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "name": "Authenticated User",
  "phonenumber": "+2348123456789"
}

### 2. Verify Payment (Public - No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/verify?reference=YOUR_TX_REF_HERE

### 3. Get User Payments (Requires Authentication)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/my
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Get All Payments (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. Get Payment Statistics (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/stats
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Get Payment by ID (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/PAYMENT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Update Payment Status (Admin Only)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/payments/PAYMENT_ID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "successful"
}

### 8. Flutterwave Webhook (Public - Webhook Endpoint)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/webhooks/flutterwave
Content-Type: application/json
verif-hash: YOUR_DEV_FLUTTERWAVE_SECRET_KEY

{
  "event": "charge.completed",
  "data": {
    "tx_ref": "TEST12345678",
    "status": "successful",
    "amount": 5000,
    "charged_amount": 5000,
    "payment_type": "card"
  }
}
